From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 01:59:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: AnyCatalog, store.write, and registry context for
 Neural Computer

Add AnyCatalog so hosts can store a catalog without repeating
Catalog<any, any, any>. ObservableDataModel.write is the orchestrator
write seam (in-memory implements it as set). JSONUIProvider publishes
registry via context so Renderer can omit a second copy. ComponentRenderer
uses a bivariant call signature so memoized host components type-check
without casts.
